ocalized or rich. Use only when additional detail or guidance is needed beyond the label."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"It should remain short, clear and scannable, helping the user to understand what happened and what he can do next."}],"type":"paragraph"}],"name":"description"},{"name":"bulletList","content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"An optional list of bullet points, each one raw, localized or rich, to be displayed in the alert message following the label or the optional "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"description"},{"type":"text","text":"."}]}]},{"name":"link","content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"An optional link to be displayed in the alert message. It can be used to trigger an action.","type":"text"}]}]},{"name":"disableVoiceOverAnnouncement","content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Disables the automatic VoiceOver announcement of the alert message when it appears. Default is "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"false"},{"type":"text","text":"."}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"An optional callback invoked when the close button is clicked. If ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"nil"},{"text":", the close button is not displayed and the alert message","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"remains visible until the context changes (e.g., the issue is resolved, the screen is refreshed). Otherwise, the alert message is dismissable and","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"includes a close button, allowing the user to dismiss it when he has acknowledged the message.  Some alerts must remain visible to ensure","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":"user is aware of important information; others can be closed to reduce visual clutter."}]}],"name":"onClose"}],"kind":"parameters"},{"content":[{"text":"Discussion","type":"heading","anchor":"discussion","level":2},{"type":"paragraph